WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
The gray side of a warship rises overhead against a cloudy sky.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
A dockside crane carries a submarine bow plane while a rigger below holds its tag line.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.400
A worker on scaffolding keeps a gloved hand on the hanging plane.

00:14.400 --> 00:20.400
An overhead crane carries a long lifting beam hung with magnets above stacks of steel plate.

00:20.400 --> 00:25.500
Sparks fly from a torch cutting steel.
